    {
      "heading": "说明",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"markdown\"><h4>【样例解释】</h4>\n<p>可行方案：<span class=\"katex math inline\">5 \\rightarrow 4 \\rightarrow 8 \\rightarrow 16 \\rightarrow 17</span>，共移动 <span class=\"katex math inline\">4</span> 次。</p>\n<h4>【数据范围】</h4>\n<p>对于 <span class=\"katex math inline\">100</span>%的数据，满足 <span class=\"katex math inline\">X</span> 和 <span class=\"katex math inline\">Y</span> 在数轴范围内。数轴长度为 <span class=\"katex math inline\">100000</span> 。</p>\n</div>\n\n                    \n                </div>",
